/*
 * AgonLight2Flash.ld - The functions linked into on-chip flash, included into
 * the .text output section of AgonLight2.ld.  Any function not named here is
 * linked into .ramtext and runs from external SRAM after agonLight2LoadRamText()
 * loads it, so new code goes to RAM unless it is added to this list.  Code that
 * runs before that load (the boot path and anything an interrupt reaches) must
 * be listed; the AgonLight2Makefile link step checks this.  Delete a line to
 * move a function to RAM.
 */

